                <note rend="inline" type="source">874.00/481</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Bulgarian Chargé</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Petroff Tchomakoff</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 158</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-05-21">May 21, 1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I am instructed to bring to your knowledge
                    that the new Bulgarian Government will continue the policy of cooperation with
                    the League of Nations, of friendly relations with all powers and understanding
                    with the neighboring states.</p>
                <p>Please accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed>S. W. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petroff</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
